Today is Thursday.
It is now afternoon.
I am in the office.
I am working on the laptop.
Rohan comes near me.
We chat.
Rohan asks, "Maya, what do you do in the evening?"
I say, "I go to the gym on Tuesday and Thursday."
"But I want to meet new people here."
Rohan asks, "Can you play any sport?"
I say, "Yes, I can play well."
"I like to play badminton."
Rohan says, "There is a badminton club nearby here."
"Many people come there."
"You can also go there."
I like this idea.
So I am not going to the gym on Thursday now.
I only go to the gym on Tuesday.
I am going there to play badminton today at half past five!
